[en.FOCUS_C11_THESTRAL_EXCUSE]
Fool You Twice

[en.FOCUS_C11_THESTRAL_EXCUSE_desc]
Use the same trick again, claiming that the army stationed in Drungar was attacked by the Thestral and Cerberus and suffered casualties, as an excuse to further invade Tartarus.

[zh.FOCUS_C11_THESTRAL_EXCUSE]
故技重施

[zh.FOCUS_C11_THESTRAL_EXCUSE_desc]
故技重施，宣称驻扎在德伦加尔的军队遭到了夜骐和三头犬的袭击，造成了军队伤亡，以此为借口展开对塔尔塔洛斯的进一步侵略。

